    "intro_narrative": "The neon hum of Neo-Kyoto's undercity buzzes outside the reinforced glass. You are trapped in the server room of the Arasaka sub-grid, surrounded by cooling towers and blinking terminals. Your exit—the Mainframe Airlock—is sealed tight. To escape before the ICE countermeasures fry your neural link, you must navigate a web of encrypted data, physical keys, and legacy protocols. Scattered around the room are various hacking tools and locked containers. You'll need to chain these systems together, feeding the output of one into the next, to synthesize the final key.",
    "narrative_style": "cyberpunk"
